        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(f) An Employee shall be given at least forty-five (45) days advance notice of a Permanent Transfer. Unless unknown or unforeseen conditions prevent the Company from giving such notice, an Employee shall be given at least seven (7) days advance notice of a Temporary Transfer to a Work Location sixty five (65) road miles or more from the Employee's Applicable Computation Point; and notification prior to the end of the Employee's tour on the work day preceding a Local Assignment.",
